Cell["Interactive Exploration", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"cd383640-a88e-884f-b2dc-185d6e82d99c"],

Cell["\<\
Lab 7A is an instant BuildControlBasis anatomy explorer: vary basis family, \
parameter budget P, B-spline degree, slice count Nt, and envelope window to \
inspect columns of B = diag(w) B_raw alongside the singular-value spectrum \
and condition number kappa(B) in real time.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7bfac57a-b400-c94e-9b44-39f9674ad6b1"],

